      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really dont have time for a doctor visit right now. my schedule is crazy and i can't really afford a co-pay just for a toothache. i'm already taking the omeprazole every single day, so wouldn't that basically protect my stomach lining from the ibuprofen? it's just standard stuff, so i figured it should be fine to just take a couple of advil to get through the week.",
